WEBVTT

00:03.640 --> 00:09.270
Wall Maria contained one third
of humanity's remaining territory.

00:10.360 --> 00:13.860
Five years ago,
when humanity lost this territory,

00:14.240 --> 00:17.470
from within the remaining
two walls, they realized:

00:18.330 --> 00:22.370
"That we...
are not meant to continue living."

00:23.710 --> 00:28.010
After all,
humanity cannot defeat the Titans.

00:28.960 --> 00:30.500
I'm going to drive out...

00:30.880 --> 00:34.970
...every last one from this world!

00:36.180 --> 00:40.940
However, one young man gripped
that small blade held in his heart,

00:41.640 --> 00:46.750
and thrust it into a Titan, pounding its
massive head into the ground.

00:47.980 --> 00:52.150
When humanity saw this,
what did they think?

00:53.530 --> 00:55.320
Some were proud.

00:56.030 --> 00:57.870
Some held hope.

00:58.700 --> 01:01.200
Some cried out in anger.

01:02.790 --> 01:08.960
Then, if Wall Maria was retaken,
what would humanity cry out?

01:10.040 --> 01:15.050
Would they finally start believing
that humanity deserves to live?

01:15.310 --> 01:18.970
Advance!

01:21.890 --> 01:25.270
That our own fate is
something we can decide?

01:26.020 --> 01:28.800
Will it be enough for them to believe?

01:30.520 --> 01:34.370
If only Wall Maria was retaken...

03:09.960 --> 03:14.960
"The Town Where Everything Began"

03:21.510 --> 03:22.510
Whoa!

03:22.511 --> 03:25.219
Hey! You've gotta light up the ground!

03:25.220 --> 03:26.660
S-Sorry.

03:27.010 --> 03:30.269
We're not at the foot yet?
It's almost dawn.

03:30.270 --> 03:33.900
Once we're over this mountain,
Shiganshina's right there.

03:35.520 --> 03:37.780
Sorry you're stuck with my horse.

03:38.190 --> 03:40.739
You're supposed to be saving your energy.

03:40.740 --> 03:42.279
Yeah, I know.

03:42.280 --> 03:44.739
She's right. Rest up, Eren.

03:44.740 --> 03:46.409
Don't say his name, idiot.

03:46.410 --> 03:48.699
Oh, yeah, sorry.

03:48.700 --> 03:51.690
Assume this place is
swarming with enemies.

03:53.920 --> 03:57.290
Titan on the left! Everyone halt!
Light up the area!

04:00.130 --> 04:02.599
It's all right. He's fast asleep.

04:02.600 --> 04:06.170
This lad must not be one of those
new types that moves at night.

04:07.430 --> 04:10.470
That's too bad. Let him be.

04:16.610 --> 04:19.939
I can't believe we didn't
see it till that close up.

04:19.940 --> 04:22.609
Yeah, I'm with you there.

04:22.610 --> 04:26.659
This moonless night must be protecting us.

04:26.660 --> 04:29.700
Light from the moon is reflected sunlight.

04:30.260 --> 04:31.619
The new type of Titan...

04:31.620 --> 04:36.430
We think they use that minuscule
amount of reflected light to move.

04:36.880 --> 04:39.380
Using the new moon was the right move.

04:40.170 --> 04:43.630
There's no guarantee we won't
have a repeat of before.

04:44.380 --> 04:48.420
That lad may be one of those
"Moonlight Titans" for all we know.

04:49.430 --> 04:52.270
Hope we capture one someday!

04:59.980 --> 05:01.250
I'm shaking?

05:02.570 --> 05:05.750
Why? What am I so scared of?

05:07.240 --> 05:08.240
Shit...

05:08.870 --> 05:12.450
If I screw up retaking Wall Maria
because I'm like this, what then?!

05:13.500 --> 05:15.880
How many people will lose hope forever?

05:16.370 --> 05:19.290
There won't be a chance
like this ever again!

05:20.750 --> 05:23.020
Am I not cut out for it after all?

05:23.710 --> 05:28.139
Someone like me? How can I save humanity?

05:28.140 --> 05:30.640
Someone like me? How?

05:33.100 --> 05:34.389
Eren...

05:34.390 --> 05:38.599
What are you shaking for? Are you scared?

05:38.600 --> 05:40.859
Huh?! I'm not scared!

05:40.860 --> 05:44.280
Huh? You're kidding... Look at your hand.

05:44.440 --> 05:49.279
This is... It's cold!
My hand's damn freezing!

05:49.280 --> 05:53.650
Really? My whole body's been
shaking this whole time.

05:54.660 --> 05:55.600
See?

05:59.330 --> 06:02.220
Eren, have you ever been afraid of Titans?

06:04.000 --> 06:06.800
Normally, everyone's terrified of them.

06:07.130 --> 06:13.090
Like me... The first time I faced a Titan,
I couldn't move a muscle.

06:13.850 --> 06:16.420
But... there I was...

06:16.770 --> 06:19.390
And you pulled me right
out of a Titan's mouth.

06:20.600 --> 06:23.760
How were you able to
do something like that?

06:27.990 --> 06:29.260
I remembered...

06:29.990 --> 06:32.530
...the time you showed me that book.

06:33.990 --> 06:37.910
Up until then, I never once thought
about what was outside the walls.

06:39.330 --> 06:42.740
I just spent every day
staring at the clouds and sky.

06:44.630 --> 06:49.060
But then, I heard your story
and looked into your eyes.

06:51.090 --> 06:53.440
You were seeing an awesome dream.

06:54.090 --> 06:55.470
But I had nothing.

06:56.770 --> 06:58.730
That's when I knew.

06:59.440 --> 07:01.150
I wasn't free.

07:02.560 --> 07:04.526
Trapped in a small
cage in a huge world,

07:04.551 --> 07:07.924
my freedom stolen by
those unthinkable fiends.

07:09.190 --> 07:12.960
When I realized that,
I couldn't forgive them.

07:14.120 --> 07:18.800
I don't know why, but when it
comes to taking back freedom...

07:19.660 --> 07:23.220
Yes... Strength flows through me.

07:26.270 --> 07:27.460
Thanks for that.

07:27.960 --> 07:29.259
I'm good now.

07:29.260 --> 07:30.919
Mmm.

07:30.920 --> 07:36.260
I bet, by this time next year,
we'll be looking at the sea.

07:40.480 --> 07:42.940
I recognize this area.

07:45.150 --> 07:49.030
I think... we came here for firewood.

07:52.070 --> 07:54.699
I can see the foot!

07:54.700 --> 07:56.620
There's signs of a trail!

07:58.910 --> 08:01.249
It's so close.

08:01.250 --> 08:03.289
I can hear the river.

08:03.290 --> 08:06.590
Finally, we're back...

08:08.210 --> 08:11.760
The first time... since we fled from here.

08:13.050 --> 08:15.430
Back to our hometown...

08:32.360 --> 08:35.949
Be on guard for Titans
hiding in the shadows!

08:35.950 --> 08:38.329
Our operation begins now!

08:38.330 --> 08:41.660
All troops, switch to ODM gear!

08:49.920 --> 08:54.339
There's two gates we must seal...
the inner and outer.

08:54.340 --> 08:56.639
With that, Shiganshina will be isolated.

08:56.640 --> 08:59.180
We'll exterminate any Titans left inside.

09:00.140 --> 09:04.180
If the enemy knows our plan,
they'll go straight after Eren, but...

09:08.980 --> 09:14.489
We'll have hoods covering the faces
of all 100 of our soldiers.

09:14.490 --> 09:19.410
By the time they find out who Eren is,
we'll have the outer gate plugged.

09:32.920 --> 09:34.919
Don't stop!

09:34.920 --> 09:37.379
Head for the outer gate!

09:37.380 --> 09:38.510
Roger!

09:43.390 --> 09:45.139
This is...

09:45.140 --> 09:47.060
...the remains of a fire?

09:50.860 --> 09:54.149
They're here... and close!

09:54.150 --> 09:56.110
Bertholdt and Reiner!

10:03.540 --> 10:06.289
My house is right around there.

10:06.290 --> 10:10.250
That's where... we left everything behind.

10:17.590 --> 10:20.550
It's okay, I'll take it all back!

10:24.560 --> 10:27.229
This is all too strange...

10:27.230 --> 10:30.189
Not a single Titan in sight?

10:30.190 --> 10:32.019
But we have to keep going.

10:32.020 --> 10:35.610
Yeah, there's no reason to call it off.

10:42.070 --> 10:45.869
I can do this! No...

10:45.870 --> 10:48.659
We can do this!

10:48.660 --> 10:54.289
Because we've all been special
since the day we were born!

10:54.290 --> 10:56.510
We're free!

11:47.640 --> 11:49.929
Don't let your guard down!

11:49.930 --> 11:51.269
Keep on the lookout!

11:51.270 --> 11:52.480
Roger!

11:54.770 --> 11:55.730
Eren!

11:55.731 --> 11:57.979
How's your ODM gear?

11:57.980 --> 11:59.489
It's fine.

11:59.490 --> 12:02.610
But I did manage to lose my cloak.

12:07.740 --> 12:09.159
Thanks.

12:09.160 --> 12:10.869
Mmm.

12:10.870 --> 12:13.039
The hole?!

12:13.040 --> 12:14.500
Success!

12:15.540 --> 12:17.540
It's plugged all right!

12:21.130 --> 12:23.219
We did it!

12:23.220 --> 12:24.639
Eren, you okay?

12:24.640 --> 12:26.139
No problems here.

12:26.140 --> 12:27.929
I'm ready like we trained.

12:27.930 --> 12:29.769
We'll head for the inner gate!

12:29.770 --> 12:33.390
While we're on the move,
remember to hide your faces!

12:36.270 --> 12:40.399
I really plugged the hole?
And that easily...?

12:40.400 --> 12:42.029
You did it.

12:42.030 --> 12:44.110
Believe in your own power.

12:46.950 --> 12:48.990
The hole from then...

12:51.750 --> 12:53.369
Not yet!

12:53.370 --> 12:58.129
No matter how much you plug it, they'll
break the wall as long as they live.

12:58.130 --> 13:01.759
Until we kill Reiner, Bertholdt,
and any other enemies,

13:01.760 --> 13:04.679
the operation to retake
Wall Maria won't end.

13:04.680 --> 13:07.260
Of course... I know that!

13:09.260 --> 13:12.139
The outer gate was a success.

13:12.140 --> 13:14.639
Still, it's odd...

13:14.640 --> 13:16.809
There's no attack coming.

13:16.810 --> 13:21.859
On the contrary, we've not seen
a single Titan so far.

13:21.860 --> 13:25.449
Were they not prepared
for our sudden assault?

13:25.450 --> 13:27.279
We can only hope, but...

13:27.280 --> 13:29.829
Considering what Arlelt discovered...

13:29.830 --> 13:31.699
Hmm?

13:31.700 --> 13:33.289
I looked into it.

13:33.290 --> 13:36.709
I'm pretty sure someone was camping.

13:36.710 --> 13:40.879
The pot was cold and lights
were scattered on the ground.

13:40.880 --> 13:43.710
They were drinking
something like black tea.

13:45.260 --> 13:49.009
Smells good... What is this drink?

13:49.010 --> 13:53.469
Also, there were three cups
with drops of a black liquid in it.

13:53.470 --> 13:56.519
At the least, there were
three people atop the wall.

13:56.520 --> 13:58.849
Th-Three, you say?!

13:58.850 --> 14:01.269
Was the metal pot completely cool?

14:01.270 --> 14:02.190
Yes.

14:02.191 --> 14:03.529
I find that odd.

14:03.530 --> 14:04.440
Agreed.

14:04.441 --> 14:07.239
Th-The pot?

14:07.240 --> 14:12.789
We charged here at full speed
using horses and ODM gear.

14:12.790 --> 14:17.119
Had they noticed our approach
by sound or by sight,

14:17.120 --> 14:19.789
they'd have two minutes to react.

14:19.790 --> 14:24.049
A pot in use wouldn't
cool in just two minutes.

14:24.050 --> 14:28.339
They had to have known we were
coming for five minutes or more.

14:28.340 --> 14:31.969
Meaning they've had plenty
of time to prepare for us.

14:31.970 --> 14:34.179
But... how?

14:34.180 --> 14:39.019
Th-There must be a scout in addition
to the three on the wall...

14:39.020 --> 14:43.899
No, we have to assume there's
many more enemies in hiding.

14:43.900 --> 14:47.109
For now, locating the
enemy is our priority.

14:47.110 --> 14:48.399
Arlelt...

14:48.400 --> 14:52.949
With that brain of yours, you've saved
us from disaster countless times.

14:52.950 --> 14:56.249
Right now is one of
those times we need you.

14:56.250 --> 14:58.119
Huh?

14:58.120 --> 15:00.209
Take as many soldiers as needed.

15:00.210 --> 15:03.500
Find out if enemies are hiding
near the inner gate or not.

15:05.800 --> 15:09.299
As of now,
you obey Armin Arlelt's commands.

15:09.300 --> 15:11.300
Continue the search!

15:15.890 --> 15:16.720
R...

15:16.721 --> 15:17.889
Roger!

15:17.890 --> 15:19.979
We searched the wall thoroughly!

15:19.980 --> 15:22.270
What are your orders, Arlelt?!

15:24.230 --> 15:26.569
Send one group to each side of the wall!

15:26.570 --> 15:29.189
Search all the buildings
near the inner gate!

15:29.190 --> 15:31.910
Report any findings
with an acoustic shell!

15:33.240 --> 15:36.489
A-All right?

15:36.490 --> 15:37.750
Roger!

15:41.830 --> 15:43.629
Another big gamble of yours?

15:43.630 --> 15:46.669
No, he's proven himself.

15:46.670 --> 15:49.919
He's one of our greatest weapons.

15:49.920 --> 15:52.629
Eren's coming to plug the inner gate.

15:52.630 --> 15:54.049
What now?

15:54.050 --> 15:57.010
Pause the operation
until we find the enemy?

15:58.810 --> 16:00.979
We continue.

16:00.980 --> 16:04.359
We'll lose a prolonged battle
in enemy territory.

16:04.360 --> 16:08.729
For us, our only chance
is with a decisive battle.

16:08.730 --> 16:14.989
Besides, if this is all according to the
enemy's plan, we'll just have to live with it.

16:14.990 --> 16:19.790
In any case, they're not the
only ones hiding something.

16:26.340 --> 16:28.589
What do I do?

16:28.590 --> 16:32.009
Eren's coming to seal the inner gate...

16:32.010 --> 16:34.680
And we don't know where the enemy's at!

16:35.760 --> 16:39.809
Why haven't they shown
even though we plugged the wall?

16:39.810 --> 16:43.639
Why can't we find them
no matter how much we search?

16:43.640 --> 16:46.059
This is bad... What now?

16:46.060 --> 16:49.729
If we fail... that'll really be the end!

16:49.730 --> 16:52.609
It's over. Everything...

16:52.610 --> 16:57.199
They always attack us in unthinkable
ways we always fail to predict.

16:57.200 --> 16:59.579
We're always at a disadvantage because...

16:59.580 --> 17:02.870
...we simply know nothing about Titans!

17:03.910 --> 17:05.500
Always...?

17:21.810 --> 17:23.429
Did you find them, Arlelt?!

17:23.430 --> 17:24.390
Where are they?!

17:24.391 --> 17:27.349
Not yet! Everyone search the walls!

17:27.350 --> 17:29.269
I told you we already did!

17:29.270 --> 17:30.899
There's nowhere to hide!

17:30.900 --> 17:32.650
Inside the walls!

17:33.820 --> 17:35.149
Inside the walls?

17:35.150 --> 17:36.319
Yes!

17:36.320 --> 17:40.409
There must be a spot where someone
could stay inside for a long time!

17:40.410 --> 17:42.330
How do you know that?!

17:45.160 --> 17:46.290
It's a hunch.

17:47.170 --> 17:50.589
Do you have any idea what
sort of situation we're in?!

17:50.590 --> 17:53.009
We don't have time to waste on hunches!

17:53.010 --> 17:54.669
Think about it!

17:54.670 --> 17:59.349
The enemy always attacks us using
Titan powers in ways we never imagine!

17:59.350 --> 18:02.429
If we constrain ourselves to
common sense and reason,

18:02.430 --> 18:05.430
we'll never be able to
gain the upper hand!

18:13.900 --> 18:16.149
The signal to halt the mission!

18:16.150 --> 18:19.029
All troops,
scatter and stand by atop the wall!

18:19.030 --> 18:20.490
Roger!

18:22.120 --> 18:25.749
There are times to be strict
and times to be flexible.

18:25.750 --> 18:29.999
Adhere to the principles you vowed
while giving everything you've got.

18:30.000 --> 18:32.209
Obey the chain of command.

18:32.210 --> 18:35.260
The reason we are here
is to claim victory!

18:37.800 --> 18:40.679
Break into two groups again
and search the surface!

18:40.680 --> 18:42.639
Especially above the gate!

18:42.640 --> 18:44.470
Commence the search!

18:45.520 --> 18:46.390
Rog...

18:46.391 --> 18:47.770
Roger!

18:55.230 --> 18:57.149
What are they doing?

18:57.150 --> 19:00.109
Should we really be waiting like this?

19:00.110 --> 19:03.950
Yeah, so much for our surprise attack...

19:04.910 --> 19:08.370
Armin... Did you figure something out?

19:16.420 --> 19:21.049
A position to react, no matter
when Eren appears...

19:21.050 --> 19:24.099
A position able to see everything...

19:24.100 --> 19:28.389
If there is such a place,
it has to be in the walls.

19:28.390 --> 19:32.769
If the enemy has no idea we know
about the Titans in the walls,

19:32.770 --> 19:36.069
and they think we'll
never see it coming...

19:36.070 --> 19:37.400
Or possibly...?

19:44.160 --> 19:47.040
Here! There's a cavity here!

19:59.050 --> 20:00.380
Reiner!

20:18.440 --> 20:19.400
Shit!

20:19.400 --> 20:20.030
...Captain?!

20:20.030 --> 20:20.690
...Is that another Titan power?!
...Captain?!

20:20.691 --> 20:21.859
...Is that another Titan power?!

20:21.860 --> 20:25.370
So close! But I couldn't finish 'em!

20:43.130 --> 20:45.339
Keep on the lookout!

20:45.340 --> 20:47.260
Locate his allies!

21:23.050 --> 21:24.799
Boulder incoming!

21:24.800 --> 21:26.760
Get down!

21:31.180 --> 21:32.389
What the...?!

21:32.390 --> 21:34.019
Did he miss?

21:34.020 --> 21:37.899
No... That was good aim.

21:37.900 --> 21:43.069
He plugged the entrance.
Now the horses can't pass.

21:43.070 --> 21:45.489
They'll aim for the
horses and surround us...

21:45.490 --> 21:50.079
...in order to block our escape
and annihilate us here.

21:50.080 --> 21:52.949
We're both hoping for the same thing.

21:52.950 --> 21:56.039
To settle it here once and for all.

21:56.040 --> 21:58.209
Humanity or Titans?!

21:58.210 --> 22:02.420
Which side will live?!
Which side will perish?!

23:41.020 --> 23:44.649
A horde of Titans appears out of nowhere.

23:44.650 --> 23:46.939
As they vie to settle the fight,

23:46.940 --> 23:53.369
the once friend becomes enemy
and stands in Eren's way.

23:53.370 --> 23:54.619
Next episode: "Thunder Spears."

23:54.620 --> 23:56.589
"Thunder Spears"
